        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወውዕየ ፡ ሣልስተ ፡ እዴሃ ፡ ለምድር ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የምድር ፡ ሲሦም ፡ ተቃጠለ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወውዕዩ ፡ ኵሉ ፡ ዕፅ ፡ ወሐመልማል ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሣሩ ፡ ዕንጨቱ ፡ ቅጠሉ ፡ ተቃጠለ ። አን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድም ፡ በሽሕ ፡ ቢመጡ ፡ (ኮነ ፡ በረድ) ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደመ ፡ በለስን ፡ ከማፍሰስ ፡ ጋራ ፡ በሰው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሁሉ ፡ ለኃጢአት ፡ መናደድ ፡ ከምግባር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከትሩፋት ፡ መባረድ ፡ ሆነ ፡ (ወውዕየ) ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከሰው ፡ ሲሦው ፡ ጠፋ ፡ በነፍስ ፡ ተጎዳ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "(ወውዕዩ) ፡ የክፉዎች ፡ ሰዎች ፡ ነፍሳ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቸው ፡ የበጎዎች ፡ ሰዎች ፡ ሥጋቸው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የሚጎዳ ፡ ሆነ ። አንድም ፡ በማእከለ ፡ ዘ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መን ፡ ቢመጡ ፡ (ኮነ ፡ በረድ) ፡ ደመ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወልደ ፡ እግዚአብሔርን ፡ ከማፍሰስ ፡ ጋራ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በአይሁድ ፡ ለኃጢአት ፡ መናደድ ፡ ከም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ግባር ፡ ከትሩፋት ፡ መባረድ ፡ ሆነ ። (ወው",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዕየ) ፡ ከአይሁድ ፡ ነው ፡ ሲሦዎቹ ፡ ጠፉ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "(ወውዕዩ ፡ ሣዕር) ፡ ሣዕር ፡ ኦሪት ፡ አስተ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጋብእ ፡ ሣዕረ ፡ ደብር ፡ እንዲል ፡ ሐመል",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ማል ፡ ወንጌል ፡ ወእምክልኤሆሙ ፡ ሐመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልማለ ፡ ዘርዕ ፡ እንዲል ፤ ጠፉ ፡ አለ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሕጋቸው ፡ አለመጠበቁን ፡ መናገር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነው ፡ ዘፀአ ፡ ፱ ፡ ፳፫ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": "፰",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፰ ፤ ወሶበ ፡ ጠቅዐ ፡ ካልእ ፡ መልአክ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በሁለተኛው ፡ መንፈቅ ፡ ሁለተኛው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መልአክ ፡ ሥራውን ፡ በሠራ ፡ ጊዜ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወረደ ፡ ውስተ ፡ ባሕር ፡ እሳት ፡ ዐቢይ ፡ ዘመጠነ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደብር ፡ እንዘ ፡ ይነድድ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተራራ ፡ የሚያክል ፡ እሳት ፡ እየበራ ፡ እየ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነደደ ፡ ወደ ፡ ባሕር ፡ ወረደ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወኮነ ፡ ደመ ፡ ሣልስተ ፡ እዴሃ ፡ ለባሕር ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የባሕር ፡ ሲሦው ፡ ደም ፡ ሆነ ፡ ከሦስቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ባሕር ፡ አንዱ ። አንድም ፡ ከዚያው ፡ ካ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንዱ ፡ ባሕር ፡ ሲሦው ፤ ኤር ፡ ፶፩ ፡ ፳፭ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 35,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘፀአ ፡ ፯ ፡ ፳ ፥ ፳፩ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 2,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": "፱",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፱ ፤ ወሞተ ፡ ሣልስተ ፡ እዴሁ ፡ ለዘሀሎ ፡ ውስተ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ባሕር ፡ ዘተፈጥረ ፡ ዘቦ ፡ መንፈሰ ፡ ሕይወት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በባሕር ፡ ተፈጥሮ ፡ በደመ ፡ ነፍስ ፡ ሕይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወት ፡ ሕያው ፡ ሆኖ ፡ ከሚኖር ፡ ፍጥረት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሁሉ ፡ ሲሦው ፡ አለቀ ፡ አለ ፡ በድምፅ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምግብ ፡ ቢለወጥበት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወሣልስተ ፡ እዴሆን ፡ ለአሕማር ፡ ማሰና ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከመርከቦችም ፡ ሲሷቸው ፡ ጠፉ ፡ ከሦ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስቱ ፡ መርከቦች ፡ አንዱ ። አንድም ፡ ከአ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንዱ ፡ መርከብ ፡ አልፎ ፡ አልፎ ፡ መቀ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደድ ። አንድም ፡ በሽሕ ፡ ቢመጡ ፡ (ወረ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደ ፡ እሳት) ፡ ሰባት ፡ ዓመት ፡ በደብር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቅዱስ ፡ በምግባር ፡ በትሩፋት ፡ የኖሩትን፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያህል ፡ በደብር ፡ ቅዱስ ፡ በነበሩ ፡ አበው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለኃጢአት ፡ መናደድ ፡ ከምግባር ፡ ከትሩ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፋት ፡ መባረድ ፡ ሆነ ፡ (ወኮነ ፡ ደመ) ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከከተማው ፡ ሲሦው ፡ ጠፋ ፡ ከሦስቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከተማ ፡ አንዱ ። አንድም ፡ ካንዱ ፡ ሲሦ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ው ፡ (ወሞተ ፡ ሣልስተ ፡ እዴሁ) ፡ በዚህ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዓለም ፡ ተፈጥሮ ፡ በነባቢት ፡ ነፍስ ፡ ሕይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወት ፡ ሕያው ፡ ሆኖ ፡ ከሚኖር ፡ ሰው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሁሉ ፡ ሲሦው ፡ ጠፋ ፡ አለ ፡ በነፍስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተጎዳ ፡ (ወሣልስተ) ፡ ከአበውም ፡ ሲሦ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዎቹ ፡ ጠፉ ፡ አለ ፡ በነፍስ ፡ ተጎዱ ። አን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድም ፡ በማእከለ ፡ ዘመን ፡ ቢመጡ፡(ወረደ)",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዲያብሎስ ፡ እየተናደደ ፡ ወደ ፡ ጥሙ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቃኑ ፡ ወረደ ፡ ደብር ፡ አለው ፡ ስለ ፡ ትዕ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቢቱ፡ (ጥቅ)፡ምንትኑ ፡ ዝ ፡ ደብር፡ ቅድመ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘሩባቤል ፡ ወሰመዮ ፡ ደብረ ፡ በእንተ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትዕቢቱ ፡ እንዲል ፡ (ወኮነ ፡ ደመ) ፡ ከጥ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሙቃኑ ፡ ሲሦዎቹ ፡ ጠፉ ፡ አለ ፡ በነፍስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተጎዱ ፡ (ወሞተ) ፡ በሐዲስ ፡ ተፈጥሮ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በመንፈሳዊ ፡ ሕይወት ፡ ሕያው ፡ ሆኖ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከሚኖር ፡ ሰው ፡ ሁሉ ፡ ሲሦው ፡ ሞተ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 35,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አለ ፡ በነፍስ ፡ ተጎዳ ፡ (ወሣልስተ ፡ እዴ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 36,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሆን) ፡ ከመምህራኑም ፡ ሲሦዎቹ ፡ ጠፉ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 37,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አለ ፡ በነፍስ ፡ ተጎዱ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": "፲",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፲ ፤ ወሶበ ፡ ጠቅዐ ፡ ሣልስ ፡ መልአክ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በሦስተኛው ፡ መንፈቅ ፡ ሦስተኛው ፡ መ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልአክ ፡ ሥራውን ፡ ሠራ ፡ በሠራ ፡ ጊዜ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወረደ ፡ እምሰማይ ፡ ኮከብ ፡ ዐቢይ ፡ እንዘ ፡ ይነድድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከመ ፡ እሳት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከሰማይ ፡ ታላቅ ፡ ኮከብ ፡ እንደ ፡ እሳት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እየነደደ ፡ እየበራ ፡ ወረደ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወወረደ ፡ ውስተ ፡ ሣልስተ ፡ እዴሆሙ ፡ ለአፍላግ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወለአንቅዕተ ፡ ማያት ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በአፍላግ፡ በአንቅዕት፡ በሲሷቸው፡ ወረደ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አፍላግ ፡ የሚላቸው ፡ እንደ ፡ መገጭ ፡ እን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደ ፡ ጉማራ ፡ አንቅዕት ፡ እንደ ፡ ቅሀ ፡ እን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደ፡ አንገረብ፡ ያሉ፡ ናቸው ። አንድም ፡ አፍ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ላግ ፡ የሚላቸው ፡ እንደ ፡ ዐባይ ፡ እንደ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በሽሎ ፡ እንደ ፡ ርብ ፡ አንቅዕት ፡ እንደ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መገጭ ፡ እንደ ፡ ጉማራ ፡ ያሉ ፡ ናቸው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኢሳ ፡ ፲፬ ፥ ፲፪ ። ዳን ፡ ፰ ፥ ፲ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": "፲፩",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፲፩ ፤ ወስሙ ፡ ለውእቱ ፡ ኮከብ ፡ ዕጉስታር ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስሙም ፡ ሬቶ ፡ ይባላል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወኮነ ፡ ዕጉስታረ ፡ ሣልስተ ፡ እዴሆሙ ፡ ለማያት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከውኃው፡ሲሦው፡ ሬት፡ ሆነ፡ አለ፡ መረረ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ምስለ ፡ ዐውሎ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወረደ ፡ ምስለ ፡ ዓውሎ ፡ ከጠሮ ፡ ጋራ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወረደ ፡ ጥቅል ፡ ነፋስ ፡ ማለት ፡ ነው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወብዙኅ ፡ ሰብእ ፡ ዘሞተ ፡ እምነ ፡ ምረሮሙ ፡ ለማ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያት ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከውኃውም ፡ ምረት ፡ የተነሣ ፡ የሞተው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰው ፡ ብዙ ፡ ነው ፡ በድምፅ ፡ ምግብ፡ ቢለ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወጥበት ። አንድም ፡ በሽሕ ፡ ቢመጡ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "(ኮከብ ፡ ዐቢይ) ፡ ዲያብሎስ ፡ ነው ፡ እፎ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወድቀ ፡ ኮከበ ፡ ጽባሕ ፡ እንዲል ፡ እንደ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እሳት ፡ እየተናደደ ፡ ከእስራኤል ፡ በልዑ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ላኑ ፡ በትሑታኑ ፡ ወረደባቸው ፡ ስሙ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እብስትዮን ፡ ይባላል ፡ ሕግ ፡ የሚለዋ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውጥ ፡ ማለት ፡ ነው፡ (ወኮነ) ፡ የኩሌቶች፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የእስራኤል ፡ ሕጋቸው ፡ ተለወጠ ፡ ወረ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደ ፡ ምስለ ፡ ዓውሎ ፡ ከማሳት ፡ ጋራ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወረደ ፡ (ወብዙኅ ፡ ሰብእ) ፡ ከሕጉም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መለወጥ ፡ የተነሣ ፡ በነፍስ ፡ የተጎዱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብዙ ፡ ናቸው ። አንድም ፡ በማእከለ ፡ ዘ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መን ፡ ቢመጡ ፡ (ኮከብ ፡ ዐቢይ) ፡ ዲያ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብሎስ ፡ ነው ፡ እየተናደደ ፡ ወረደ ፡ ከጥ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሙቃኑ ፡ በልዑላኑ ፡ በትሑታኑ ፡ ወረደ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስሙም ፡ እብስትዮን ፡ ይባላል ፡ አእምሮ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የሚለዋውጥ ፡ ማለት ፡ ነው ፡ ከጥሙቃኑ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የኩሌቶች ፡ አእምሯቸው ፡ ተለወጠ ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "(ወረደ ፡ ምስለ ፡ ዓውሎ) ፡ ከማሳት ፡ ጋራ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወረደ ፡ ከአእምሯቸውም ፤ መለወጥ ፡ የተ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነሣ ፡ በነፍስ ፡ የተጎዱ ፡ ብዙ ፡ ናቸው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": "፲፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፲፪ ፤ ወሶበ ፡ ጠቅዐ ፡ ራብዕ ፡ መልአክ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ባራተኛው ፡ መንፈቅ ፡ አራተኛው ፡ መል",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አክ ፡ ሥራውን ፡ በሠራ ፡ ጊዜ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
